<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Plot on KevCaz's Website</title><link>https://kevcaz.github.io/tags/plot/</link><description>Recent content in Plot on KevCaz's Website</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><copyright>Content under CC0 1.0 Universal unless otherwise specified.</copyright><lastBuildDate>Fri, 02 Aug 2019 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://kevcaz.github.io/tags/plot/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Variables in mathematical expressions in a plot with R</title><link>https://kevcaz.github.io/notes/2019/08/2019-08-02_variables_in_mathematical/</link><pubDate>Fri, 02 Aug 2019 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://kevcaz.github.io/notes/2019/08/2019-08-02_variables_in_mathematical/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;It is rather straightforward to &lt;a href="https://stat.ethz.ch/R-manual/R-devel/library/grDevices/html/plotmath.html"&gt;add mathematical annotation in a plot with R&lt;/a&gt;. However, I have noted that people struggle with the two following :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;combining mathematical expression and text;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;using variables&amp;rsquo; values within an expression.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The first one is actually easy, you just need to add and quotation marks to add text in &lt;code&gt;expression&lt;/code&gt; and to use &lt;code&gt;*&lt;/code&gt; to concatenate elements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div style="color:#575279;background-color:#faf4ed;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"&gt;
&lt;table style="border-spacing:0;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#575279;background-color:#faf4ed;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"&gt;2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;;width:100%"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#575279;background-color:#faf4ed;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-R" data-lang="R"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;plot&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;c&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ea9d34"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ea9d34"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;),&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;c&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ea9d34"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ea9d34"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;),&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;type&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#ea9d34"&gt;&amp;#34;n&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;text&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ea9d34"&gt;0.5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#ea9d34"&gt;.5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;labels&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;expression&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;delta&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;==&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#ea9d34"&gt;&amp;#34;cool&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ea9d34"&gt;+2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;+&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;italic&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ea9d34"&gt;&amp;#34;super&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;bold&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ea9d34"&gt;&amp;#34;cool&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ea9d34"&gt;+3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;+&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;beta&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;),&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#d7827e"&gt;cex&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#ea9d34"&gt;3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#797593"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="../../notes/2019/08/2019-08-02_variables_in_mathematical/assets/expression.png" alt=""&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>